{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00685","headline":"郊庙歌辞 太清宫乐章 序入破第一奏 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 太清宫乐章 序入破第一奏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"真宗开妙理，冲教统清虚。\n化演无爲日，言昭有象初。\n瑶台肃灵瑞，金阙映仙居。\n一奏三清乐，长回八景舆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00685.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00685","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}